"a Docusaurus site on Cloudflare.

  created    worker/ask-my-site.ts  the Worker: POST /api/ask and /api/mcp; other requests get the static files
  updated    wrangler.toml          sets main to worker/ask-my-site.ts, and the static assets' binding to ASSETS

Set (init reads none of these):
  OPENAI_API_KEY, for the Worker: npx wrangler secret put OPENAI_API_KEY
  OPENAI_API_KEY, for the site’s build: a build variable; without it there, the index is keyword-only, which works too

Next:
  1. npm i ask-my-site ai @ai-sdk/openai @radix-ui/react-dialog cmdk
  2. Add the plugin to docusaurus.config: plugins: ['ask-my-site/docusaurus']
  3. Deploy as you do now. init has deployed nothing."
`;

